<title>USA: Merrill wins $65 mln Jefferson Cty, Ky., revs.</title>
<headline>Merrill wins $65 mln Jefferson Cty, Ky., revs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said it won $65 million of Jefferson County, Ky., capital projects corporation lease revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost (NIC) of 5.47 percent.</p>
</text>
